  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The number of quadratic polynomials&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> which satisfy the following conditions is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math></p>\r\r<p>(i) <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></math> are distinct</p>\r\r<p>(ii)&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3,4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mn>2001,2002</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi></math></p>\r\r<p>(iii) <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> divides <math><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>.</p>\r\r<p>Then <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "20.02",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is the root of the quadratic equation <math><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi></math> and <math><mi>c</mi></math> both must be even or odd.<br />So, the total number of quadratic polynomials,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><mrow/><mn>1001</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><mrow/><mn>1001</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1001</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1001</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20.02</mn></math>",
